1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,679
This is tape seagrass, Enhalus acoroides.

2
00:00:03,039 --> 00:00:05,518
A display, not a scan of a meadow in Mati.

3
00:00:05,918 --> 00:00:07,932
The leaves are very long ribbons.

4
00:00:08,152 --> 00:00:11,381
Their edges roll inward.

5
00:00:11,661 --> 00:00:14,385
They are not the short flat straps of the ribbon seagrasses.

6
00:00:15,435 --> 00:00:21,834
The rhizome is thick, with long black bristles, and the roots are cord-like.

7
00:00:22,114 --> 00:00:24,327
The meadow spreads by that thick buried stem.

8
00:00:24,567 --> 00:00:27,171
Male and female flowers grow on separate plants.

9
00:00:27,391 --> 00:00:29,359
This model does not show the flowers.

